l stress-test the connection between the two groups. The technical side handles the product creation, design, and scientific testing. The commercial side handles the procurement of raw materials, the administration of the organization, the logistics of distribution, the actual selling, and the management of human resources. This covers the entire value chain. The categories are distinct: technical is about the physical/digital product and its design/production, while commercial is about the business processes that enable the product to exist and reach the market. The strongest direction is to ensure every identified area is mapped to these two functional pillars without overlap, treating specific vocational titles as the primary units of information.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nchemical engineering technology, electrical engineering technology, food technology, industrial sales, information technology, lab technology (chemistry), logistics, mechanical engineering technology, mechatronics, metalworking, office administration, personnel services, purchasing, technical drawing<|im_end|>"
