ce of the work and the company's mission are communicated through specific, modern channels to build a holistic attractiveness. I need to ensure I don't mistake the tools for the criteria. The criteria are the qualities of the employment itself. I will focus on how these qualitative elements—flexibility, growth, and purpose—are synthesized into a brand that is verified by external sources.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nNew Work, attractiveness criteria, career opportunities, career websites, press coverage, rating portals, sustainability<|im_end|>"
