y only have insurance, are they supported? No, because they lack the mechanism for preventative physical wellness. The strength of the solution lies in the combination of preventative physical activity, specialized medical access, and protective insurance mechanisms. I will focus my direction on these overlapping layers.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\ndental services, grants for multi-sport cards, international health insurance, life insurance, physiotherapy, regular exercise, special conditions for medical services<|im_end|>"
