emissions serves as a quantitative indicator of this technological impasse.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nPORR's Scope 1 GHG emissions have remained relatively constant compared to the previous year. This stability is attributed to the lack of sufficient technologically viable alternatives to replace fossil fuels in the company's operations.<|im_end|>"
