p structure to secure talent, which serves the market presence, while simultaneously driving systemic equity to satisfy social impact and ESG objectives.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nWith 23% of employees and 27% of net sales based in the U.S., the company sees it as crucial to become an employer of choice among underrepresented racial and ethnic groups in this market. This aligns with its goal to increase the share of U.S. leadership roles (roles 4+) held by these groups from 23% in 2023 to 30% by 2030.<|im_end|>"
