cance of the metric as a reflection of institutional priority.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nThe Antitrust training is tailored for a specific group of 268 employees to address their unique responsibilities related to competition laws. With over 97 percent completing the training, it demonstrates the program's success in ensuring this group is well-prepared to handle antitrust issues.<|im_end|>"
