t they are too distal from the actual evaluation process described. The strongest direction is to identify the entities by mapping the entire procedural chain: starting with the subjects of the evaluation and following the workflow through the specific functional units identified in the text. This requires grouping the portfolio companies as the source and the specific acronym-based units as the evaluators.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nINDUS, OBUK, WIRUS, portfolio companies<|im_end|>"
