olves identifying the specific, paired financial metrics for Turnover, CapEx, and OpEx.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nOpEx, capital expenditure, consolidated net revenue, eligible revenue, global turnover, operating CapEx, total CapEx, total revenue<|im_end|>"
