he technical requirements of the Taxonomy.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nAustrian Federal Public Procurement Act, Bundesvergabegesetz, authorisation, financial, economic and technical performance, invitations to tender, professional reliability, relevant platforms, suitability of suppliers<|im_end|>"
