ontent. The framework 2020/852 provides the what and the why, while the delegated acts 2021/2139 and 2022/1214 provide the how through specific Annexes. The recent updates like 2023/2486 ensure the how is current. This covers both eligibility through the inclusion of activities in these acts and alignment through the technical criteria within the annexes. The distinction between the objectives within 2021/2139 is vital because an activity might be eligible for mitigation but fail the adaptation criteria, making the granular distinction between Annex 1 and Annex 2 necessary for a precise evaluation of alignment.",
