arly sovereign debt, which falls outside the current technical screening criteria regardless of its underlying impact. I need to focus my analysis on the conceptual gap between the definition of an \"activity\" and the nature of \"securities\" as financial instruments that do not map directly to those activities.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nThe exposures of Addiko Bank AG are not considered taxonomy-eligible under Article 8 because its activities involve managing a securities book with investments in government bonds, which do not qualify as taxonomy-aligned activities.<|im_end|>"
