, and mechanisms, which are the tools used to reach those outputs, is critical. If I include the mechanisms, I will overcount. If I include the drivers, I will also overcount. The strongest direction is to count only those SDGs that are mapped directly to the stated strategic objectives or pillars of the development plan. I will now double-check if any other SDGs are mentioned in the governance or reporting sections to ensure no implicit priorities were missed. The governance section discusses compliance and transparency but does not attach a specific SDG number to these activities, meaning they are general corporate procedures rather than highlighted SDG priorities. This confirms that the core of the solution lies in the specific mapping of goals to strategic pillars.",
