al assets to a specific ecological function, involves a clear chain of actors, and addresses the consequence of ecosystem collapse by supporting a foundational biological group. I need to verify if this specific synergy between real estate assets, professional beekeeping, and local ecosystem health constitutes a coherent and scalable biodiversity strategy.",
