 I must also check if I am missing anything. Does Wacker contribute to water management? While they might, it isn't as central to their documented strategic pillars as the others. The connection between their chemical mechanisms—like high-purity silicon and specialized polymers—and the societal outputs of digital growth, mobile green energy, efficient housing, and biological well-being creates a consistent logic. The strongest direction is to identify these sectors as the specific societal transitions enabled by their specialized material science.",
