ic environmental parameters—temperature control, oxygen availability, and salinity—to the different certification types. I must ensure the final answer encompasses both the managed waste streams and the natural ecosystems while maintaining the critical distinctions between industrial, home, soil, fresh water, and marine contexts.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nfresh water, home, industrial, marine, soil<|im_end|>"
