d to categorize these technologies by their function within that ecosystem. I must distinguish between the power systems that enable sustainability, the digital architectures that enable intelligence, and the automated systems that enable safety and efficiency. The innovation isn't just in the \"what\" (the electric motor) but in the \"how\" (the connectivity and digitalization that manage it) and the \"capability\" (the automation and driver assistance that refine the experience). I need to look for a set of advancements that covers the entire spectrum from the mechanical drive to the digital brain. The most robust solution will likely involve a convergence where the propulsion technology provides the environmental foundation, while the digital and automated layers provide the innovative mobility framework. I will now focus on verifying whether these categories—propulsion, digital connectivity, and automated control—collectively satisfy all parts of the prompt.",
