s to view the tenant services as a tripartite system: the technological layer for automated efficiency, the manual layer for resource preservation through repair, and the communicative layer for behavioral guidance and troubleshooting. I need to focus on how these three layers—automation, maintenance, and communication—interlock to create a comprehensive support structure for both the environment and the tenant's lifestyle. I will now examine how the role of the caretaker and the craftsman acts as the bridge between the physical building and the tenant's daily resource consumption.",
