specific objectives, such as circularity or decarbonization, map to the technical definitions of the specific SDGs like 12 and 13, and how its product applications map to goals like 3 and 6. This dual-layered structure prevents the error of being too broad to be meaningful or too narrow to be accurate.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\n17 SDGs, SDG 12, SDG 13, SDG 3, SDG 6, Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)<|im_end|>"
