ses the ESG requirement by including the renewable category. I am now focusing on a solution that distinguishes between the physical form of the energy and its origin. The strongest direction involves a comprehensive categorization that includes electricity, gas, oil, steam, and renewable energy sources.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nelectricity, gas, oil, renewable energy sources, steam<|im_end|>"
