e rollout could be an indefinite process, but the phrase expected to be completed implies a finite, scheduled conclusion. The most robust approach is to trace the timeline from its 2021 inception through its intermediate regional phases to its final global realization. The solution must identify the year that serves as the terminal point for this entire sequence of expansion.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nLaunched in 2021, expected to be completed in 2025, further European countries, global rollout, introduction of Slim Pack<|im_end|>"
