he full spectrum of the materiality matrix, from internal organizational health to external societal and environmental impacts. The strength of this direction lies in its ability to capture the specialized language of the report rather than applying a generic external template. I will focus on locating these specific, multi-faceted thematic groupings that bridge the gap between the company's core activities and its ESG responsibilities.",
