es more quickly. This satisfies both the communication and the process objectives. The sustainability comes from the iterative nature of the loop—it is a system designed to evolve. The direction of the solution lies in a structured, regionalized feedback mechanism that uses optimized communication as a diagnostic tool to drive continuous internal process refinement.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nOngoing improvement of internal processes, Optimisation of our regular communication formats, lively interactions across all regions, possible solutions, regular communication on weak points, respond to customer enquiries more quickly<|im_end|>"
  },
