ual physical change. The most robust direction involves a multi-layered approach. I must categorize the measures into three distinct types: technological upgrades to the load to increase efficiency, renewable energy installations to improve the energy mix, and financial mechanisms that facilitate these transitions. I also need to ensure I distinguish between the reduction in energy consumption and the reduction in environmental impact, as they are related but distinct objectives. I will now focus on testing how these technological specifics, like the thermal properties of heating components and the specific shift in lighting technology, interact with the broader goal of altering the energy mix via renewable infrastructure.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nLEDs, bright radiators, dark versions, energy consumption, energy efficiency, energy mix, grant towards switching the lighting, photovoltaic (PV) system<|im_end|>"
