le. If a division produces superabsorbents, is that innovation-driven? Yes, because the material science required to control fluid absorption is highly specialized. Is it a solution for sustainable growth? Yes, as it relates to resource management and hygiene efficiency. The pattern is consistent. The strongest solution direction lies in identifying the cluster of divisions that transition from basic chemical supply to specialized, high-performance functional applications that enable downstream sustainability.\n**Final Answer**\n<|im_start|>answer\nNutrition & Care, Performance Intermediates, Smart Materials, Specialty Additives, Superabsorbents business, functional solutions business<|im_end|>"
