gy name to provide context, then separate the structural pillars—which include both the thematic scope of the ESG spectrum and the core operational mechanism of transforming banking operations—from the specific commitments, which include the climate-related targets and the nature of their voluntary undertakings. This approach ensures that the distinction between the \"what\" (the ESG scope), the \"how\" (the banking transformation), and the \"to what end\" (net zero and climate combat) is maintained. This direction allows for a comprehensive answer that avoids the trap of treating the entire strategy as a single list of items.",
